{"id":"629089","name":"木耳枸杞芽拌蛋","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629089/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"枸杞芽","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"一小把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳泡发好，洗净冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/629089/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮开5分钟。","img":"images/629089/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮木耳的同时，另外起锅烧油。","img":"images/629089/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/629089/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒熟。","img":"images/629089/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放盘子里。","img":"images/629089/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"木耳再次反复揉搓洗净，沥干水分。","img":"images/629089/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放鸡蛋盘子里。","img":"images/629089/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"枸杞芽洗净。","img":"images/629089/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"焯水。","img":"images/629089/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开捞出，摆盘。","img":"images/629089/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切红椒末和蒜末。","img":"images/629089/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放菜里。","img":"images/629089/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"撒食盐。","img":"images/629089/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放白醋。","img":"images/629089/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629089/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}